# This is the build context ignore file for the garage-bridge add-on image
# (built with context = repo root, -f garage-bridge/Dockerfile). The `**/`
# prefix matters: a bare `node_modules` only matches at the context root,
# so nested copies (e.g. the Mac's garage-bridge/ingest/node_modules with
# darwin binaries) would otherwise be sent and COPY'd into the build.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
.superpowers
.git
supabase/.temp
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.env.local
